0..70 Comment "//! The checker refuses the laws on terms of a category with families."
71..109 Comment "//! Huang and Angiuli state these laws"
110..186 Comment "//! [Huang-2026-fat_cell_structures_generalized_algebraic_theories], § 1.1."
187..190 Comment "//!"
191..266 Comment "//! A law on terms relates two sides whose sorts agree only modulo a law on"
267..344 Comment "//! types. The sort of `subTm(t, id(g))` is `Tm(g, subTy(a, id(g)))`, and the"
345..375 Comment "//! sort of `t` is `Tm(g, a)`."
376..379 Comment "//!"
380..455 Comment "//! The reading carries an index only as a variable or an operation without"
456..530 Comment "//! indices of its own. The index `subTy(a, id(g))` applies `subTy`, which"
531..562 Comment "//! carries the context of `a`."
563..566 Comment "//!"
567..583 Comment "//! - see: #5042"
584..660 Comment "//! - cites: [Huang-2026-fat_cell_structures_generalized_algebraic_theories]"
